@host = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### Login (admin@example.com موجود بعد migrate:fresh --seed في local)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "password", "device_name": "http-file" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Corp", "email": "billing@acme.test" }

### List products (copy a product id from here)
GET {{host}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json